<title>PHILIPPINES: Philbank says Q1 net at 59.116 mln pesos.</title>
<headline>Philbank says Q1 net at 59.116 mln pesos.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Philippine Banking Corp had posted a net income of 59.116 million pesos in the first quarter of the year, documents submitted to the Philippine Stock Exchange on Wednesday said.</p>
<p>Interest income reached 338.940 million pesos.</p>
<p>No comparative figures were immediately available.</p>
<p>-- MANILA NEWSROOM (63 2) 841-8938 Fax 817-6267</p>
</text>
